<title>USA: United Technologies sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>United Technologies sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>HARTFORD, Conn. 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Technologies Corp said Monday its board of directors approved a two-for-one split of the company's common stock in the form of a stock dividend.</p>
<p>The new shares will be distributed December 10 to shareholders of record at the close of business November 22.</p>
<p>The board also doubled the outstanding authorization for the repurchase of the company's common stock in keeping with the stock split, the company said.</p>
</text>
